      "thumbUrl": "https://jahelcuadrado.github.io/ExerciseGymGigsDB/biceps/kettlebell-bottoms-up-clean-from-the-hang-position.thumb.webp"
    },
    {
      "id": "biceps/kettlebell-double-alternating-hang-clean",
      "slug": "kettlebell-double-alternating-hang-clean",
      "name": "壶铃交替悬垂翻举双",
      "muscle": "biceps",
      "bodyPart": "arms",
      "equipment": "kettlebell",
      "category": "strength",
      "secondaryMuscles": [
        "glutes",
        "hamstrings",
        "spine",
        "traps",
        "delts",
        "forearms"
      ],
      "instructions": [
        "选择合适重量的壶铃。紧握壶铃把手，保持手腕中立。",
        "双脚与髋同宽，杠铃在脚掌中间上方。下沉髋部，抬起胸部，手臂伸直——消除杠铃的松弛。",
        "爆发性地推地，伸展髋部和膝盖。当杠铃过膝后，以猛烈的伸髋和耸肩加速。",
        "快速下沉到杠铃下方，在肩膀（翻举）或头顶（抓举）接住杠铃。用柔软的膝盖缓冲接杠，然后站起。",
        "每次交替两侧。完成一侧完整的一次后再做另一侧。",
        "呼吸：发力时呼气，回程时吸气。进行大重量复合动作时，深吸一口气到腹部，在最难的部分保持住。"
      ],
      "file": "biceps/kettlebell-double-alternating-hang-clean.gif",
      "gifUrl": "https://jahelcuadrado.github.io/ExerciseGymGigsDB/biceps/kettlebell-double-alternating-hang-clean.gif",
      "thumbUrl": "https://jahelcuadrado.github.io/ExerciseGymGigsDB/biceps/kettlebell-double-alternating-hang-clean.thumb.webp"
    },
